    {
      "id": "84fd6fe6-e136-4675-8fbc-57f0f661cfb3",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        208,
        -272
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 500,
        "height": 240,
        "content": "## Error alerts (n8n app)\nEvery 5 minutes it reads the error executions from the n8n API and sends a push to the n8n Connect admins (nc_users rows with role `admin`). The n8n app turns it on and off by publishing/unpublishing it, so keep this exact name.\n\nThe first run only records the existing errors (no backlog). More than 3 new errors at once: one summary push."
      }
    }
